title: ieexec Download and Execute
id: 6bb6b7f6-29f6-4566-9640-343cf5570590
status: experimental
description: Detects ieexec.exe launching a .NET application from a remote http URL, a signed LOLBin technique to download and execute managed code.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\ieexec.exe'
    CommandLine|contains: 'http'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - None expected on modern systems
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.command_and_control
  - attack.t1218
